        "sys_dao_marks"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Annexing Qi Sea grotto-heaven adds about a million qi path dao marks. Those marks spread through the sovereign immortal aperture’s mini five regions and nine heavens and visibly remake its environment, including how heaven qi and earth qi behave. Qi Xiang’s life accumulation plus more than ten myriad tribulations over thousands of years produced that million-mark foundation.",
      "chapters": [
        1816
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "annexing-qi-sea-grotto-heaven",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_qi_sea_grotto_heaven",
        "char_qi_xiang"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "With one million qi path dao marks, Fang Yuan’s rank seven killer move heavenly astral cloth robe rises about a thousand times in power, reaching rank eight defense while still spending rank seven immortal essence. A million qi path dao marks is framed as a scale normally only rank nines possess; dao mark amplification alone is not treated as a reliable path to true rank nine killer moves.",
      "chapters": [
        1817
